### Obtener todos los usuarios
GET http://localhost:3000/api/user

### Obtener un usuario por id
GET http://localhost:3000/api/user/69c939906535a62b46204c19

### Obtener informacion del usuario post-login (nickname, nombre y apellido, mail y chats)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/user/login/69c939946535a62b46204c1a

### Enviar correo de verificacion para alta de usuario
POST http://localhost:3000/api/user/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nickname": "CoolAir",
    "firstname": "Pedro",
    "lastname": "Lolas",
    "email": "",
    "passwd": ""
}

### Generar token para pruebas
POST http://localhost:3000/api/user/test
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "id": "69c939946535a62b46204c1a"
}

### Obtener token de sesion por correo y contraseña
POST http://localhost:3000/api/user/auth/login/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "passwd": "12345678",
    "email": "stuka@gmail.com"
}

### Alta de usuario
POST http://localhost:3000/api/user/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nickname": "thedud",
    "firstname": "John",
    "lastname": "Egbert",
    "email": "stuka@gmail.com",
    "passwd": "12345678",
    "chatrooms": [],
    "messages": []
}

### Modificar usuario
PATCH  http://localhost:3000/api/user/69c939906535a62b46204c19
Authorization: eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6kpXVCJ9.eyJkYXRhIjp7ImlkIjoiNjljOTM5OTA2NTM1YTYyYjQ2MjA0YzE5In0sImlhdCI6MTc3NzgxNDY0NCwiZXhwIjoxNzc4MDczODQ0fQ.xS5y0xV8sLigwjJFKoc9axS9QIiCprJWa8PY8x8v2G0
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "passwd": "123444",
    "chatrooms": ["69c9aa1817be65126fb37929"]
}

### Borrar Usuario
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/user/69f2886e220b2766c8de5582
Authorization: eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJkYXRhIjp7ImlkIjoiNjlmMjg4NmUyMjBiMjc2NmM4ZGU1NTgyIn0sImlhdCI6MTc3NzgxNDc3MCwiZXhwIjoxNzc4MDczOTcwfQ.WVR3x-loBFeJN6ZGQT1_fVObrf3Ot5SjnRn0HSgYrCY